					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-624230#post-2308255</guid>
				<title>STAFF POST: Addition - Attribution Notice.</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-624230/have-a-heart#post-2308255</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2015 00:43:18 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Dexanote</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>481882</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>At Decibelle's suggestion we are adding a variant of the disclaimer used on <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-173">SCP-173</a>'s page detailing our relationship with images of the IRL sculpture.</p> <p>As stated in the article, SCP-173 is a secondary use of the image of the art piece &quot;Untitled 2004&quot;, which was created by Izumi Kato. The concept of SCP-173 does not have any relationship with the artist's original concept of &quot;Untitled 2004&quot;.</p> <p><strong>Images of the &quot;Untitled 2004&quot; sculpture may be used for non-commercial purposes only.</strong></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
